IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `topca-minor`

-- Tobacco and Other Products Control Act 2006 (WA), the minor's questions (ss 6, 7, 12, 13, 15, 30A, 30B, 99-101, 106) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_tobacco-and-other-products-control-act-2006_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake/facts.json (Jake born 30 August 2006; k031
-- on 2 June 2023, aged 16: "Caught with a vape outside the campus"). The fixture ASSUMES one disposable vape.
-- The personal use quantity (2), commercial quantity (60) and large commercial quantity (600) are HYPOTHETICAL
-- placeholders in one unit, not the regulations' figures, which are not deposited. The commercial quantity matches
-- the placeholder used in the Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 baseline.

