§ `30B -- is my possession an offence`

-- life event k031 (Jake, 2 June 2023): the deposited edition starts on 13 May 2026, so the day is not answered;
-- on the same facts under the deposited edition, one vape is within the (hypothetical) personal use quantity.
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `Jake's vape, 2 June 2023` EQUALS `not answered: the day is before the deposited edition (13 May 2026)`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2026` EQUALS `no offence: no more than the personal use quantity (s 30B(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `five vapes at 16` EQUALS `an offence under s 30B(2): more than the personal use quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `a commercial quantity of vapes` EQUALS `an offence under s 30B(4): at least the commercial quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `a large commercial quantity of vapes` EQUALS `an offence under s 30B(5): at least the large commercial quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `five vapes at 30` EQUALS `an offence under s 30B(2): more than the personal use quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `a packet of legal cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `no offence: the Act makes no offence of possessing this`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `no offence: no more than the personal use quantity (s 30B(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my possession an offence` `a prescribed vape on the conditions at 16` EQUALS `no offence: a therapeutic vaping product held on the prescribed conditions (s 30B(6))`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for my possession` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2026` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for my possession` `five vapes at 16` EQUALS 600000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for my possession` `a large commercial quantity of vapes` EQUALS 4200000

§ `6, 30A, 106 -- the supply to me`

-- life event k031: the shop's sale is the offence the scenario names; under the deposited edition it is s 30A, not s 6.
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `Jake's vape, 2 June 2023` EQUALS `not answered: the day is before the deposited edition (13 May 2026)`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2026` EQUALS `an offence under s 30A (a prohibited product, to anyone)`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a packet of legal cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `an offence under s 6 (to a person under 18)`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a packet of legal cigarettes at 30` EQUALS `no offence under this Act`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `an offence under both s 6 and s 30A`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 30` EQUALS `an offence under s 30A (a prohibited product, to anyone)`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a lighter at 16` EQUALS `no offence under this Act`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a prescribed vape on the conditions at 16` EQUALS `no offence under this Act`

#ASSERT NOT `Was selling me a look-alike an offence` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)`
#ASSERT `Was selling me a look-alike an offence` `a food, toy or other product designed to look like a tobacco or vaping product`

#ASSERT `What is the most the seller can be fined under s 6` FALSE FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most the seller can be fined under s 6` TRUE TRUE EQUALS 100000

§ `7, 15(2) -- getting it`

#ASSERT `Would I offend in getting it` `a tobacco product (cigarette, cigar, loose tobacco or herbal smoking product) that meets the packaging and product requirements` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Would I offend in getting it` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `Would an adult buying it for me offend` `a tobacco product (cigarette, cigar, loose tobacco or herbal smoking product) that meets the packaging and product requirements` 16 EQUALS "s 7"
#ASSERT `Would an adult buying it for me offend` `an illicit tobacco product (one that breaks a tobacco product or packaging requirement)` 16 EQUALS "s 7 and s 30A"
#ASSERT `Would an adult buying it for me offend` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)` 16 EQUALS "s 30A, by supplying it to me"

§ `12, 13, 15(1) -- proof of age`

#ASSERT `Is this document proof of my age` `a current Australian driver's licence` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is this document proof of my age` `a student card or other document` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is this document proof of my age` `an expired passport or licence` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT `May the seller refuse me without proof of age` `a tobacco product (cigarette, cigar, loose tobacco or herbal smoking product) that meets the packaging and product requirements`
#ASSERT NOT `May the seller refuse me without proof of age` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)`

#ASSERT `Does the seller have the s 13 defence` TRUE 16 TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Does the seller have the s 13 defence` TRUE 13 TRUE TRUE

§ `99-101 -- what may be done to me`

-- life event k031 under the deposited edition: Jake's vape may be taken by police if he cannot show proof of 18, and is destroyed.
#ASSERT `May the item be taken from me` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)` `a police officer` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `May the item be taken from me` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)` `a police officer` TRUE TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT `What happens to my seized item` `a vaping product (a vape, pod, cartridge or vaping liquid, with or without nicotine)` 2 TRUE EQUALS `destroyed`
#ASSERT `What happens to my seized item` `a tobacco product (cigarette, cigar, loose tobacco or herbal smoking product) that meets the packaging and product requirements` 5 TRUE EQUALS `returned to me`
#ASSERT `What happens to my seized item` `a tobacco product (cigarette, cigar, loose tobacco or herbal smoking product) that meets the packaging and product requirements` 8 TRUE EQUALS `destroyed`

#ASSERT `Must I give my details` `a police officer` TRUE 16
#ASSERT NOT `Must I give my details` `an investigator` TRUE 13

#ASSERT `May my parent be told` `a police officer` TRUE

